# Paths the pre-push hook doesn't gate a push to main for. A push whose
# commits change only these skips cicd.bash --merge-gate. One shell glob a
# line, matched against the repo-relative path, where * also matches /.
# project/ isn't listed whole, since the tests read project/example.shcl.
# Its docs are .md, so the first line covers them. The workflows stay gated,
# since release.yml runs on main.
*.md
assets/*
.github/CODEOWNERS
.github/FUNDING.yml
.github/dependabot.yml
